node.doctext:
Hello , I'm trying to make a monitor that counts in and and out unicast packets :
<code>
my $in;
my $out;
while (1){
$in = system("snmpget -Oqv -v2c -c randomstr localhost 1.3.6.1.2.1.31.1.1.1.7.3");
$out = system("snmpget -Oqv -v2c -c randomstr localhost 1.3.6.1.2.1.31.1.1.1.11.3");
system("rrdtool update opit11.rrd N:$in:$out") ;
sleep 10;
}
</code>
When executing the code i see the number of packets on the terminal .When i execute <code> rrdtool fetch opit11.rrd --start -100 </code> it shows only zeroes <code>0.0000000000e+00 </code> for the time that the script was running .
If somoene can point me where is my mistake ? 
Thank you !
